// Don't edit by hand: change the mark on the page, pull the export again and
// rerun the script (`tests/marks.rs` fails if this file is stale).
//
// key: the town's name in data (its roster is `assets/world/people/<key>.ron`,
// its place `assets/world/places/<key>.json`); it stays with the mark's `id`
// even if the label changes. label: what the map says (the town's own name is
// made by the naming module). px: the pixel, 150 m a pixel. kind: Capital,
// City, Town, Village, Hamlet, Outpost, Fort. holder: a faction key.
// The comment on each line says where its founders came from.
